r card for free to realize your equity. Betting would be a semi-bluff, but if you get raised, you might be forced to fold your equity or commit chips as an underdog. Taking the free card maximizes your value relative to risk.\n\nReason: You have a very strong draw (Straight + Flush) but currently no made hand (High Card). Checking allows you to see the river for free. If you hit your draw, you can bet for value; if you miss, you lose nothing.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
